  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0242_39aa92485481.png\" style=\"width: 203px; height: 160px;\" /></p><p>Let voltmeter reading is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>400</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>10000</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mn>400</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>800</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>77</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mn>25</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>150</mn><mn>77</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></math></p>"
